// The 512-tap ANALYSIS window of the polyphase filterbank, which is the second piece of data this
// format is defined by and cannot be computed from.
//
// RECOVERED BY MEASUREMENT, not transcribed. The decoder this tree depends on carries the SYNTHESIS
// window, folded into its own butterfly structure - not in a form that can be read off. So the
// window was solved for instead: the path from an input signal through this analysis to the
// decoder's output is linear in the window, so feeding the real decoder a stream built from known
// coefficients and fitting the 512 values that reproduce its output determines them. The fit's
// residual is 6e-6 of the signal, and the values that came out run to +/-0.03578 - the extreme the
// published window has.
